{"id":57326,"date":"2026-08-06T09:48:06","date_gmt":"2026-08-06T08:48:06","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=57326"},"modified":"2026-09-13T12:30:48","modified_gmt":"2026-09-13T11:30:48","slug":"biatlo-barcelos","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/biatlo-barcelos\/","title":{"rendered":"Biatlo Barcelos 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Biatlo Barcelos 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong>1.\u00ba Biatlo Aventura Barcelos \u2013 Esposende 2026<\/strong> realiza-se no domingo, <strong>13 de setembro de 2026<\/strong>, ligando os concelhos de <strong>Barcelos<\/strong> e <strong>Esposende<\/strong>, no distrito de <strong>Braga<\/strong>. Organizado pela <strong>BestMove<\/strong> com o apoio dos respetivos munic\u00edpios, o evento prop\u00f5e um formato inovador disputado em duplas (masculinas, femininas e mistas) ao longo do emblem\u00e1tico <strong>Rio C\u00e1vado<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Com partida nas <strong>Piscinas Municipais de Barcelos<\/strong> e chegada no <strong>Largo do Cortinhal (F\u00e3o \u2013 Esposende)<\/strong>, a prova totaliza cerca de <strong>15,1 km<\/strong> divididos em tr\u00eas segmentos consecutivos: <strong>5,74 km de Corrida Trail<\/strong> at\u00e9 Mariz, <strong>7 km de Kayak<\/strong> em \u00e1guas calmas at\u00e9 \u00e0 ProRiver em Fonte Boa e <strong>2,31 km de Corrida em Ecovia<\/strong> at\u00e9 \u00e0 meta final, limitado a apenas 100 duplas.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data &#038; Hor\u00e1rio<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">13 de Setembro de 2026 \u00e0s 09:00<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Local, Concelho &#038; Distrito<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Piscinas Municipais de Barcelos (Partida) \/ Largo do Cortinhal, F\u00e3o (Meta), Braga<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Dist\u00e2ncias<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">15.1 km em Duplas (5.7 km Trail + 7 km Kayak + 2.3 km Ecovia)<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Entidade Organizadora<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">BestMove \/ Munic\u00edpio de Barcelos \/ Munic\u00edpio de Esposende<\/span><\/li>\n<div style=\"grid-column: 1 \/ -1; margin-top: 8px;\"><strong style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block; margin-bottom: 10px;\">\ud83c\udfc3 Programa de Provas &#038; Sub-eventos<\/strong><\/p>\n<div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr)); gap: 12px;\">\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Biatlo Aventura<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Biatlo Aventura em Duplas<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 13 Set \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 09:00<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Pre\u00e7o Normal:<\/strong> 30.00 \u20ac \/ dupla<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 30 Ago)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">\u00daltima Semana:<\/strong> 40.00 \u20ac \/ dupla<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 06 Set)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando e onde se realiza o Biatlo Barcelos \u2013 Esposende 2026?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O evento realiza-se a 13 de setembro de 2026 (domingo), com in\u00edcio junto \u00e0s Piscinas Municipais de Barcelos e meta final no Largo do Cortinhal em F\u00e3o (Esposende).<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Como funciona o formato de participa\u00e7\u00e3o em duplas?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A prova \u00e9 disputada obrigatoriamente em equipas de dois atletas (duplas masculinas, femininas ou mistas) que realizam todos os segmentos juntos, incluindo a embarca\u00e7\u00e3o partilhada no kayak.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o as tr\u00eas etapas que comp\u00f5em o percurso total?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O percurso de 15,1 km integra um 1.\u00ba segmento de corrida trail de 5,74 km, um 2.\u00ba segmento em kayak de 7 km no Rio C\u00e1vado e um 3.\u00ba segmento final de corrida em ecovia de 2,31 km.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">O equipamento de kayak \u00e9 disponibilizado pela organiza\u00e7\u00e3o?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Sim, a organiza\u00e7\u00e3o assegura os caiaques duplos, pagaias e coletes salva-vidas homologados na zona de transi\u00e7\u00e3o aqu\u00e1tica.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 o limite de inscri\u00e7\u00f5es e valores?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A participa\u00e7\u00e3o est\u00e1 limitada a 100 duplas, com valor de 30 \u20ac por dupla na 1.\u00aa fase at\u00e9 30 de agosto e 40 \u20ac por dupla na fase final at\u00e9 6 de setembro.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<p><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Biatlo Barcelos 2026\", \"startDate\": \"2026-09-13\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Piscinas Municipais de Barcelos (Partida) \/ Largo do Cortinhal, F\u00e3o (Meta)\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Barcelos\", \"addressRegion\": \"Braga\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"organizer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"BestMove \/ Munic\u00edpio de Barcelos \/ Munic\u00edpio de Esposende\"}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quando e onde se realiza o Biatlo Barcelos \u2013 Esposende 2026?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O evento realiza-se a 13 de setembro de 2026 (domingo), com in\u00edcio junto \u00e0s Piscinas Municipais de Barcelos e meta final no Largo do Cortinhal em F\u00e3o (Esposende).\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Como funciona o formato de participa\u00e7\u00e3o em duplas?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A prova \u00e9 disputada obrigatoriamente em equipas de dois atletas (duplas masculinas, femininas ou mistas) que realizam todos os segmentos juntos, incluindo a embarca\u00e7\u00e3o partilhada no kayak.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o as tr\u00eas etapas que comp\u00f5em o percurso total?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O percurso de 15,1 km integra um 1.\u00ba segmento de corrida trail de 5,74 km, um 2.\u00ba segmento em kayak de 7 km no Rio C\u00e1vado e um 3.\u00ba segmento final de corrida em ecovia de 2,31 km.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"O equipamento de kayak \u00e9 disponibilizado pela organiza\u00e7\u00e3o?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Sim, a organiza\u00e7\u00e3o assegura os caiaques duplos, pagaias e coletes salva-vidas homologados na zona de transi\u00e7\u00e3o aqu\u00e1tica.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Qual \u00e9 o limite de inscri\